  "description": "Zero-overhead object mapper for .NET. Uses a Roslyn source generator to emit plain C# mappers at compile time — no reflection on the hot path, mapping errors as build errors, IQueryable projection support, name-based fallback, reverse mapping, and Native AOT friendly.",
  "id": "MappShark",
  "isPrerelease": true,
